add('One live turn in sequence',head('UML SEQUENCE · LAB 01 LIVE PATH','Follow the request and its return path')+svg+'<p style="position:absolute;left:80px;bottom:78px;font-size:26px">SDK port runs inside the host · cloud session runs remotely · normal path illustrated from code</p>',[
 ('seq-1','Read the sequence from top to bottom. The student chooses Run live with a prompt.'),
 ('seq-2','React posts that request through the frontend API proxy to the Lab zero one route.'),
 ('seq-3','Express validates input, opens the browser response stream, and invokes the runner with its SDK port.'),
 ('seq-4','Inside the host, that port creates the remote session, opens its events, and sends the user message.'),
 ('seq-5','The provider emits message and lifecycle events back to the host.'),
 ('seq-6','The runner consumes those events and later checks status and attempts session archival.'),
 ('seq-7','Progress frames reach the browser while events are consumed. The terminal result follows cleanup.'),
 ('seq-8','React renders the answer and outcome separately. This is a diagram of the normal live path, rather than a recorded live execution.')],['server/concepts/01-query.ts','server/lib/lab01-port.ts','server/lib/lab01-run.ts','src/concepts/Concept01Query.tsx'])
